itute of Geography and Agroecology (IGA), Chinese Academy of Sciences (CAS), located in Changchun, is a comprehensive research institute focusing on geography, agronomy, ecology, environmental science, and related technology development. We have several state research platforms including the National Wetland Research Center, the National and Local Joint Engineering Center for Crop Molecular Design and Breeding, 13 field experimental stations, multiple agricultural research and demonstration bases. For over 60 years since its establishment, the institute has made important contributions to national science and technology in the fields of black soil conservation, wetland ecology, crop breeding, etc. We have won the First Prize twice and the Second Prize thrice of the State Scientific and Technological Progress Award, and 23 times of the First Prize of S&T awards at the provin',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'http://english.iga.cas.cn/ju_17947/202301/t20230103_325977.html',NULL,1,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','c05125e2845b0bee065cce84d598fe82e65390445c19a9a9f64b044eb5e8b2f4','8a5a3bfd8187b81253d0b9301bff42490c8c4d10e9e996352a6ff278c4829531',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='http://english.iga.cas.cn/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
