 (CAS), it was amalgamated with Research Center of Ecology of CAS and was reorganized into Research Center for Eco-Environmental Sciences of Chinese Academy of Sciences (RCEES). In June 1999, it became a part of the Pilot Project of Knowledge Innovation Program of CAS.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'free','primary','not_applicable',NULL,NULL,'http://english.rcees.cas.cn/',NULL,5,'B','V2',200,'V2: institution certifiée 3/3, URL ouverte anonymement, titre et contenu vérifiés automatiquement. V3 réservé à une validation plus forte.','fe7bfdac3627b3d0908faf4bea8940fc37a2dbb9b8aad6342ab05f49d91cae6c','12d9acd6c4efe5a96a518ece2036bd10077fe12547fc86d93d892ad86a3a0378',1,1,1,1 FROM sources WHERE root_url='http://english.rcees.cas.cn/' ON CONFLICT(canonical_hash) DO UPDATE SET consulted_at=excluded.consulted_at,http_status=excluded.http_status,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,exact_title=excluded.exact_title,factual_summary=excluded.factual_summary,active=1;
